{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"Keeper 的新靴子已生成並套回原檔：兩腳都改為朝左的完整側面，並且只替換靴子／踝部矩形區域，其他原始像素保留。角色動畫正在分動作生成；播放層會沿用現有狀態與高度設定，避免影響戰鬥判定。\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat scripts/exploration/exploration_void_puppet.gd; sed -n '1,75p' scripts/exploration/exploration_boss.gd; cat scripts/exploration/exploration_keeper_chase.gd | head -100; sed -n '65,85p' scripts/exploration/exploration_player.gd; sed -n '1,80p' scripts/exploration/exploration_ling_boss.gd; cat scripts/exploration/exploration_fury_body.gd | head -55\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat scripts/exploration/exploration_void_puppet.gd; sed -n '1,75p' scripts/exploration/exploration_boss.gd; cat scripts/exploration/exploration_keeper_chase.gd | head -100; sed -n '65,85p' scripts/exploration/exploration_player.gd; sed -n '1,80p' scripts/exploration/exploration_ling_boss.gd; cat scripts/exploration/exploration_fury_body.gd | head -55\"","aggregated_output":"class_name ExplorationVoidPuppet\nextends ExplorationEnemy\n## A seat puppet on Void's red thread. Its blows soften Jerry into cloth; once down it stays down.\n\nvar controller: Node2D\nvar thread: ExplorationVoidThread\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tsuper._ready()\n\tdata = data.duplicate(true)\n\tdata[\"damage\"] = 9\n\tdata[\"speed\"] = 120\n\tadd_to_group(\"void_owned\")\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tif not is_instance_valid(controller) or controller.dead:\n\t\t_die()\n\t\treturn\n\tsuper._physics_process(delta)\n\nfunc _attack(_player: ExplorationPlayer, _behavior: String) -> void:\n\tvar hit := ExplorationHitArea.new()\n\thit.source = self\n\thit.target_layer = 8\n\thit.damage = int(data[\"damage\"])\n\thit.kind = \"puppet\"\n\thit.position = Vector2(facing*46,-40)\n\thit.dimensions = Vector2(95,70)\n\thit.direction = Vector2(facing,0)\n\tadd_child(hit)\n\nfunc _die() -> void:\n\tif is_instance_valid(thread):\n\t\tthread.queue_free()\n\tsuper._die()\nclass_name ExplorationBoss\nextends ExplorationEnemy\n## May Morley: three forms, directional anticipation, committed attacks, recovery windows.\n## Art (Codex, Demo 9): may_idle / may_windup / may_slash / may_summon / may_brush / may_brush_strike.\n\nvar phase: int = 1\nvar pattern: int = 0\nvar arena: Vector2 = Vector2(2350,3780)\nvar attack: String = \"fan\"\nvar attack_name: String = \"\"\nvar phase_title: String = \"恩师的面孔\"\nvar boss_title: String = \"梅·莫里\"\nvar echo: bool = false\nvar _floor: float = 1140\nvar _locked_facing: float = -1\nvar _target_x: float = 0\nvar _elapsed_active: float = 0\nvar _active_length: float = 0\nvar _windup_length: float = 1\nvar _fired: bool = false\nvar _second_fired: bool = false\nvar _stagger: int = 0\nvar _phase_invulnerability: float = 0\nvar _fences: Array[StaticBody2D] = []\nvar _pose_cache: Dictionary = {}\nvar _pose_key: String = \"\"\nvar _base_scale: Vector2 = Vector2.ONE\nvar _rush_hit: ExplorationHitArea\nvar _ending_sent: bool = false\nvar _intro_done: bool = false\nvar _covers: Array = []\nconst DEFEATS := {\n\t\"torn\": [\"结局 · 被撕碎\", \"美工刀切开你的时候，身体像纸一样裂开、飘落。\\n画框里只剩下一地碎屑。\\n钟声响起——你又站在美术馆门口。\"],\n\t\"sculpted\": [\"结局 · 雕塑\", \"纯白的替身把你按进石膏里。\\n凝固的瞬间，你看见自己也成了廊上的一座未完成雕像。\\n钟声响起——你又站在美术馆门口。\"],\n\t\"painted\": [\"结局 · 入画\", \"画笔在虚空里划开一道口子，把你拖进画布。\\n颜料漫过脚踝、膝盖，你成了墙上的一笔。\\n钟声响起——你又站在美术馆门口。\"],\n}\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tboss = true\n\tadd_to_group(\"may_boss\")\n\tdata = {\"hp\":int(spec.get(\"hp\",840)),\"height\":235,\"damage\":20,\"atlas\":\"may_idle\",\"speed\":55,\"behavior\":\"boss\"}\n\tarena = ExplorationCatalog.vec(spec.get(\"arena\",[2350,3780]))\n\t_floor = float(spec.get(\"floor\",spec[\"pos\"][1]))\n\tstate = \"sleep\"\n\tsuper._ready()\n\t_create_fences()\n\t# The keeper's perfect version skips the opening form and looks too clean.\n\techo = bool(spec.get(\"echo\",false))\n\tif echo:\n\t\tphase = 2\n\t\tphase_title = \"完美版本\"\n\t\tboss_title = str(spec.get(\"label\",boss_title))\n\t\tmodulate = Color(.86,.9,1)\n\nfunc _create_fences() -> void:\n\tfor x: float in [arena.x,arena.y]:\n\t\tvar fence := StaticBody2D.new()\n\t\tfence.position = Vector2(x,_floor-125)\n\t\tfence.collision_layer = 0\n\t\tfence.collision_mask = 0\n\t\tvar shape := CollisionShape2D.new()\n\t\tvar box := RectangleShape2D.new()\n\t\tbox.size = Vector2(22,250)\n\t\tshape.shape = box\n\t\tfence.add_child(shape)\n\t\tget_parent().add_child.call_deferred(fence)\n\t\t_fences.append(fence)\n\nfunc _boss_behavior(player: ExplorationPlayer, offset: Vector2, delta: float) -> void:\n\t_phase_invulnerability = maxf(0,_phase_invulnerability-delta)\n\t_watch_player(player)\n\tvelocity.x = 0\n\tif state==\"sleep\":\n\t\tif player.position.x>arena.x+40 and player.position.x<arena.y and absf(offset.y)<220:\n\t\t\t_begin_intro()\nclass_name ExplorationKeeperChase\nextends Node2D\n## Story 1.1 clock tower: the keeper climbs ahead of Jerry, raises the perfect versions of Mei\n## and Void, and rewinds time with the bell until both have fallen.\n\nvar session: ExplorationSession\nvar spec: Dictionary\nvar _tiers: Array[float] = []\nvar _keeper: ExplorationKeeperFigure\nvar _keeper_tier: int = 1\nvar _climb: float = 0\nvar _limb_timer: float = 5\nvar _bell: float = -1\nvar _busy: bool = false\nvar _hooked: bool = false\nvar _settled: bool = false\nvar _echoes: Dictionary = {}\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tz_index = -1\n\tvar room: ExplorationRoom = get_parent() as ExplorationRoom\n\tfor entry: Dictionary in room.data[\"platforms\"]:\n\t\tvar rect: Array = entry[\"rect\"]\n\t\tif str(entry.get(\"geometry\",\"\"))==\"ground\" or (str(entry.get(\"geometry\",\"\"))==\"rest\" and float(rect[2])>1000):\n\t\t\t_tiers.append(float(rect[1]))\n\t_tiers.sort()\n\t_tiers.reverse()\n\t_keeper = ExplorationKeeperFigure.new()\n\t_keeper.session = session\n\t_keeper.position = _keeper_spot(_keeper_tier)\n\troom.actors.add_child(_keeper)\n\t_keeper.visible = not session.chase_done()\n\nfunc _keeper_spot(tier: int) -> Vector2:\n\treturn Vector2(1150 if tier%2==0 else 320,_tiers[tier])\n\n## The highest floor Jerry has climbed past.\nfunc _tier_of(y: float) -> int:\n\tvar result: int = 0\n\tfor i: int in range(_tiers.size()):\n\t\tif y<=_tiers[i]+30:\n\t\t\tresult = i\n\treturn result\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tvar player: ExplorationPlayer = get_tree().get_first_node_in_group(\"exploration_player\") as ExplorationPlayer\n\tif player==null or not player.enabled or _busy:\n\t\treturn\n\tif not _hooked:\n\t\t_hooked = true\n\t\t_begin(player)\n\t# The light reddens with height.\n\tget_parent().modulate = Color.WHITE.lerp(Color(1,.72,.68),1.0-clampf(player.global_position.y/_tiers[0],0,1))\n\tif session.chase_done():\n\t\t_settle()\n\t\treturn\n\tvar rate: float = .3 if session.slow_time>0 else 1.0\n\t_spawn_echoes(player)\n\t_limb_timer -= delta*rate\n\tif _limb_timer<=0 and player.is_on_floor():\n\t\t_limb_timer = randf_range(5.5,8.5)\n\t\tvar limb := ExplorationKeeperLimb.new()\n\t\tlimb.position = player.global_position\n\t\tlimb.session = session\n\t\t(get_parent() as ExplorationRoom).actors.add_child(limb)\n\t# He keeps one floor ahead, and climbs on his own if Jerry dawdles.\n\tvar top: int = _tiers.size()-1\n\tvar wanted: int = mini(_tier_of(player.global_position.y)+1,top)\n\t_climb += delta*rate\n\tif _climb>=float(spec.get(\"interval\",40)):\n\t\t_climb = 0\n\t\twanted = mini(maxi(wanted,_keeper_tier+1),top)\n\tif wanted>_keeper_tier:\n\t\t_keeper_tier = wanted\n\t\t_keeper.warp_to(_keeper_spot(_keeper_tier))\n\t\tif _keeper_tier==top and _bell<0:\n\t\t\t_bell = 3.5\n\t\t\t_notice(\"守钟人走向钟绳……\")\n\tif _bell>=0:\n\t\t_bell -= delta*rate\n\t\tif _bell<0:\n\t\t\t_rewind(player)\n\t\t\treturn\n\t# Nobody reaches the top door while the perfect versions stand.\n\tif player.global_position.y<_tiers[top]+120 and player.global_position.x>1300:\n\t\t_rewind(player)\n\nfunc _begin(player: ExplorationPlayer) -> void:\n\tplayer.died.connect(_on_player_died)\n\tif session.chase_done():\n\t\treturn\n\tsession.save_at(\"clock_tower\",ExplorationCatalog.vec((get_parent() as ExplorationRoom).data[\"spawn\"]))\n\t_notice(\"戴帽子的身影背对着你，不断拧着巨大的发条。\")\n\n## Story 1.1: beaten by a perfect version, Jerry starts the whole climb over.\nfunc _on_player_died() -> void:\n\tif session.chase_done():\n\t\treturn\n\tfor entry: Dictionary in spec.get(\"echoes\",[]):\n\t\tsession.switches.erase(str(entry[\"flag\"]))\n\tvar capsule := CapsuleShape2D.new()\n\tcapsule.radius = 13.0\n\tcapsule.height = 62.0\n\tvar shape := CollisionShape2D.new()\n\tshape.position = Vector2(0, -31)\n\tshape.shape = capsule\n\tadd_child(shape)\n\tadd_to_group(\"exploration_player\")\n\tExplorationHitArea.hurtbox(self,8,Vector2(28,61),Vector2(0,-31))\n\tvisual = ExplorationArt.visual(self,\"hero\",105)\n\tweapon = ExplorationWeapon.new()\n\tweapon.fighter = self\n\tadd_child(weapon)\n\tz_index = 5\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\t_clock += delta\n\t_invulnerability = maxf(0.0, _invulnerability - delta)\n\t_dash_cooldown = maxf(0.0, _dash_cooldown - delta)\n\tqueue_redraw()\n\tif not enabled:\nclass_name ExplorationLingBoss\nextends ExplorationEnemy\n## Ling at the bottom of the well: a body of mud and thorned vine that fills half the chamber.\n## Mud rises without pause, vines lash from every side, hands take Jerry by the ankles and her\n## voice turns left and right around. Cutting a glowing knot makes the mud fall back and bares\n## her body for a few seconds; only then can she be hurt.\n\nconst EXPOSE_TIME: float = 5.0\nconst RECEDE: float = 170.0\nconst DROWN_DEPTH: float = 88.0\nconst DROWN_TIME: float = 1.5\nconst HOLD_TIME: float = 2.6\nconst GRIP: int = 6\nconst RISE: Array[float] = [0.0,10.0,13.0,16.0]\nconst WRAPPED: String = \"藤蔓裹身 · 砍断发光的藤结\"\nconst BARED: String = \"藤蔓松开了 · 攻击她的身体\"\nconst VOICES: Array[String] = [\"「杰利……你在哪里……」\",\"「为什么不说话？」\",\"童谣声从四面八方传来\",\"哭声盖过了一切\"]\n\nvar phase: int = 1\nvar pattern: int = 0\nvar arena: Vector2\nvar floor_y: float\nvar mud_y: float\nvar dark: float = 0\nvar attack: String = \"lash\"\nvar attack_name: String = \"\"\nvar phase_title: String = WRAPPED\nvar boss_title: String = \"玲\"\nvar _top: float = 2150\nvar _rise: float = 0\nvar _collapse: float = 0\nvar _wrap: float = 1\nvar _recede: float = 0\nvar _drown: float = 0\nvar _held: float = 0\nvar _gripped: bool = false\nvar _dragged: bool = false\nvar _warned: float = -9\nvar _windup_length: float = 1\nvar _knot: ExplorationLingKnot\nvar _knot_wait: float = 0\nvar _knot_index: int = 0\nvar _lash_count: int = 0\nvar _cage: Array[StaticBody2D] = []\nvar _strands: Array[PackedVector2Array] = []\nvar _thorns: PackedVector2Array = PackedVector2Array()\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tboss = true\n\tdata = {\"hp\":int(spec.get(\"hp\",1800)),\"height\":580,\"damage\":12,\"atlas\":\"hero\",\"speed\":0,\"behavior\":\"boss\"}\n\tarena = ExplorationCatalog.vec(spec.get(\"arena\",[215,1660]))\n\tfloor_y = float(spec.get(\"floor\",spec[\"pos\"][1]))\n\t_top = float(spec.get(\"top\",2150))\n\tmud_y = floor_y+14\n\tstate = \"sleep\"\n\ttimer = .9\n\tsuper._ready()\n\tvisual.hide()\n\tz_index = -2\n\tvar hurtbox: Area2D = get_node(\"Hurtbox\") as Area2D\n\thurtbox.position = Vector2(0,-290)\n\t((hurtbox.get_child(0) as CollisionShape2D).shape as RectangleShape2D).size = Vector2(420,560)\n\t_create_cage()\n\t_grow_thicket()\n\tvar mud := ExplorationLingMud.new()\n\tmud.boss = self\n\tadd_child(mud)\n\nfunc _create_cage() -> void:\n\tvar height: float = floor_y-_top\n\tfor rect: Rect2 in [Rect2(arena.x,_top+height*.5,22,height),Rect2(arena.y,_top+height*.5,22,height),Rect2((arena.x+arena.y)*.5,_top,arena.y-arena.x,20)]:\n\t\tvar wall := StaticBody2D.new()\n\t\twall.position = rect.position\n\t\twall.collision_layer = 0\n\t\twall.collision_mask = 0\n\t\tvar shape := CollisionShape2D.new()\n\t\tvar box := RectangleShape2D.new()\n\t\tbox.size = rect.size\n\t\tshape.shape = box\n\t\twall.add_child(shape)\nclass_name ExplorationFuryBody\nextends ExplorationEnemy\n## The other body at the well mouth. First Fury, lunging at Jerry; after the flash it is Jerry,\n## stumbling away from the player's fists, who cannot fall below the last of his blood.\n\nsignal lunged_out\nsignal beaten\n\nconst LUNGES: int = 3\nconst BLOW: int = 17\nvar boss_title: String = \"杰利\"\nvar phase_title: String = \"他还在往后退\"\nvar phase: int = 0\nvar attack_name: String = \"\"\nvar victim: bool = false\nvar glitch: float = 0\nvar _step: String = \"wait\"\nvar _lunges: int = 0\nvar _down: bool = false\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tboss = true\n\tdata = {\"hp\":100,\"height\":118,\"damage\":14,\"atlas\":\"fury_idle\",\"speed\":0,\"behavior\":\"boss\"}\n\tstate = \"sleep\"\n\tsuper._ready()\n\tz_index = 4\n\tfacing = 1\n\n## Story 1.1: \"the picture ripples a little\" when he appears.\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tif glitch<=0:\n\t\treturn\n\tglitch -= delta\n\tvisual.position.x += randf_range(-7,7) if glitch>0 else 0.0\n\tvisual.modulate.a = randf_range(.45,1) if glitch>0 else 1.0\n\nfunc begin_lunges() -> void:\n\t_step = \"windup\"\n\ttimer = .6\n\nfunc become_jerry(blood: int) -> void:\n\tvictim = true\n\tdata[\"height\"] = 105\n\tvisual.texture = ExplorationArt.sprite(\"hero\")\n\tvisual.scale = Vector2.ONE*105.0/visual.texture.get_height()\n\tmax_health = 100\n\thealth = blood\n\tstate = \"hurt\"\n\t_flash = 0\n\nfunc _boss_behavior(_player: ExplorationPlayer, offset: Vector2, _delta: float) -> void:\n\tvelocity.x = 0\n\tif victim:\n\t\tif not _down and absf(offset.x)<260:\n\t\t\tfacing = -signf(offset.x) if absf(offset.x)>2 else facing\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat > scripts/exploration/exploration_pose_animation.gd <<'EOF'\nclass_name ExplorationPoseAnimation\nextends Node\n## Presentation only: advances generated CG cels; combat clocks and hitboxes remain with hosts.\nvar visual: Sprite2D\nvar clip: String = \\\"\\\"\nvar age: float = 0.0\nvar frame_index: int = 0\nvar _source: String = \\\"\\\"\nvar _cell: int = -1\n\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tif not is_instance_valid(visual) or visual.texture == null:\n\t\treturn\n\tvar source: Dictionary = ExplorationArt.animation_source(visual.texture)\n\tif source.is_empty():\n\t\treturn\n\t_source = str(source.id)\n\t_cell = int(source.cell)\n\tvar host: Node = visual.get_parent()\n\tvar wanted: String = ExplorationArt.default_clip(_source,_cell)\n\tif host is ExplorationPlayer and _source == \\\"hero\\\":\n\t\twanted = \\\"hero_\\\" + (host.state if host.attack_phase == \\\"ready\\\" else host.attack_phase)\n\telif host is ExplorationEnemy and not host.boss:\n\t\tvar stem: String = _source + (\\\"_\\\"+str(_cell) if _cell>=0 else \\\"\\\")\n\t\tvar action: String = host.state if host.state in [\\\"windup\\\",\\\"active\\\",\\\"recover\\\"] else \\\"move\\\"\n\t\tif ExplorationArt.has_clip(stem+\\\"_\\\"+action):\n\t\t\twanted = stem+\\\"_\\\"+action\n\tif not ExplorationArt.has_clip(wanted):\n\t\twanted = ExplorationArt.default_clip(_source,_cell)\n\tif wanted \"'!= clip:\n\t\tclip = wanted\n\t\tage = 0.0\n\tvar speed: float = 1.0\n\tif \"session\" in host and host.session != null and host.session.slow_time>0:\n\t\tspeed = .3\n\tage += delta*speed\n\tvar info: Dictionary = ExplorationArt.clip_info(clip)\n\tif info.is_empty():\n\t\treturn\n\t# Fit attack cels to the existing remaining state time without changing that state.\n\tvar duration: float = float(info.get(\"duration\",.8))\n\tif not bool(info.get(\"loop\",true)):\n\t\tvar remaining: float = -1.0\n\t\tif host is ExplorationPlayer:\n\t\t\tremaining = host._attack_timer if host.attack_phase != \"ready\" else -1.0\n\t\telif host is ExplorationEnemy:\n\t\t\tremaining = host.timer if host.state in [\"windup\",\"active\",\"recover\"] else -1.0\n\t\tif remaining > 0:\n\t\t\tduration = maxf(age+remaining,.06)\n\tframe_index = ExplorationArt.animation_index(clip,age,duration)\n\tvisual.texture = ExplorationArt.animation_frame(clip,frame_index)\n\tvisual.set_meta(\"animation_clip\",clip)\n\tvisual.set_meta(\"animation_frame\",frame_index)\nEOF\npython3 - <<'\"'PY'\np='scripts/exploration/exploration_art.gd'\ns=open(p).read();s=s.replace('static func sprite(id: String, cell: int = -1, folder: String = \\\"actors\\\") -> Texture2D:', 'static func still_sprite(id: String, cell: int = -1, folder: String = \\\"actors\\\") -> Texture2D:')\ns=s.replace('host.add_child(visual)\\\\n\\\\treturn visual','host.add_child(visual)\\\\n\\\\tvar animation := ExplorationPoseAnimation.new()\\\\n\\\\tanimation.name = \\\"CGAnimation\\\"\\\\n\\\\tanimation.visual = visual\\\\n\\\\tvisual.add_child(animation)\\\\n\\\\treturn visual')\ns=s.replace('var texture: Texture2D = sprite(id)\\\\n\\\\tif texture\"'!=null'\"', 'var texture: Texture2D = still_sprite(id)\\\\n\\\\tif texture\"'!=null'\"')\ns+='''\n\nstatic var _animation_manifest: Dictionary = {}\nstatic var _animation_frames: Dictionary = {}\n\nstatic func animation_manifest() -> Dictionary:\n\tif _animation_manifest.is_empty() and FileAccess.file_exists(\\\"res://data/exploration/animations.json\\\"):\n\t\t_animation_manifest = JSON.parse_string(FileAccess.get_file_as_string(\\\"res://data/exploration/animations.json\\\"))\n\treturn _animation_manifest\n\nstatic func default_clip(id: String, cell: int = -1) -> String:\n\treturn str(animation_manifest().get(\\\"sources\\\",{}).get(id+\\\"/\\\"+str(cell),\\\"\\\"))\n\nstatic func has_clip(id: String) -> bool:\n\treturn animation_manifest().get(\\\"clips\\\",{}).has(id)\n\nstatic func clip_info(id: String) -> Dictionary:\n\treturn animation_manifest().get(\\\"clips\\\",{}).get(id,{})\n\nstatic func animation_source(texture: Texture2D) -> Dictionary:\n\tif texture.has_meta(\\\"animation_source\\\"):\n\t\treturn texture.get_meta(\\\"animation_source\\\")\n\treturn {}\n\nstatic func source_id(texture: Texture2D) -> String:\n\treturn str(animation_source(texture).get(\\\"id\\\",texture.resource_path.get_file().get_basename()))\n\nstatic func animation_index(id: String, age: float, duration: float = -1.0) -> int:\n\tvar info: Dictionary = clip_info(id)\n\tvar count: int = int(info.get(\\\"frames\\\",1))\n\tvar length: float = duration if duration>0 else float(info.get(\\\"duration\\\",.8))\n\tvar index: int = int(maxf(age,0)/length*count)\n\treturn index%count if bool(info.get(\\\"loop\\\",true)) else mini(index,count-1)\n\nstatic func animation_frame(id: String, index: int) -> Texture2D:\n\tvar key: String = id+\\\"/\\\"+str(index)\n\tif _animation_frames.has(key):\n\t\treturn _animation_frames[key]\n\tvar info: Dictionary = clip_info(id)\n\tif info.is_empty():\n\t\treturn null\n\tvar atlas := AtlasTexture.new()\n\tatlas.atlas = load(str(info.path)) as Texture2D\n\tvar size := Vector2(float(info.width),float(info.height))\n\tvar cell: int = clampi(index,0,int(info.frames)-1)+int(info.get(\\\"offset\\\",0))\n\tatlas.region = Rect2(Vector2(cell%int(info.columns),cell/int(info.columns))*size,size)\n\tatlas.filter_clip = true\n\tatlas.set_meta(\\\"animation_source\\\",{\\\"id\\\":str(info.source),\\\"cell\\\":int(info.get(\\\"cell\\\",-1))})\n\tatlas.set_meta(\\\"animation_clip\\\",id)\n\t_animation_frames[key] = atlas\n\treturn atlas\n\nstatic func sprite(id: String, cell: int = -1, folder: String = \\\"actors\\\") -> Texture2D:\n\tif folder == \\\"actors\\\":\n\t\tvar clip: String = default_clip(id,cell)\n\t\tif has_clip(clip):\n\t\t\treturn animation_frame(clip,0)\n\treturn still_sprite(id,cell,folder)\n\nstatic func moving_sprite(id: String, age: float) -> Texture2D:\n